# Mode$ SpellAbilityCopy (MagicStack.java:445, trigger.go): Twincast copies
# Disfigure, and the copy fires Grip of Chaos' "if it has a single target,
# reselect its target at random" (as Disfigure's and Twincast's casts fire
# its SpellAbilityCast line). Hill Giant is the one creature and Disfigure
# the one spell Twincast may target, so every reselection keeps its target:
# both -2/-2 land and the Giant dies.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 4 B
queue targets 7
castspell human 1
tapformana human 5 U
tapformana human 6 U
queue targets stack:1
castspell human 2
queue confirmeffect false
resolvestack
